WEBVTT

00:04.969 --> 00:08.597
<i>Yukako Yamagishi has
been in a bit of a funk lately.</i>

00:11.058 --> 00:12.434
What? You got a crush on someone?

00:12.602 --> 00:14.186
Yep! And it's mutual!

00:18.357 --> 00:21.193
So I finally went back to
Angelo's Rock and guess what?

00:21.360 --> 00:23.862
Tourists were snapping
pictures everywhere.

00:23.946 --> 00:26.073
Wow, who knew
that freak show would be a draw?

00:29.869 --> 00:31.328
What's wrong, Koichi?

00:34.415 --> 00:37.626
<i>As long as I can hold Koichi
in my heart, I have all I need.</i>

00:38.252 --> 00:41.171
<i>That's what I used to think,
before the pain became too great…</i>

00:42.757 --> 00:45.176
<i>If only he'd look at me,
even a glimpse.</i>

00:45.927 --> 00:49.013
<i>I'm at a complete and utter loss…</i>

00:50.723 --> 00:52.725
"OUR MAKEOVER WILL
HELP YOU FIND TRUE LOVE"

00:53.100 --> 00:54.267
Cinderella?

01:00.733 --> 01:02.443
It's finally happened!

01:02.860 --> 01:06.113
I can't believe that catch of a man
actually proposed to me!

01:06.447 --> 01:09.616
Thank you, Dr. Aya!
Thank you so much!

01:11.619 --> 01:12.786
Sigh…

01:13.120 --> 01:15.622
I suppose a woman's youth
is better spent

01:15.873 --> 01:19.501
a cheerful troll
than a doleful beauty…

01:20.252 --> 01:21.670
Come in.

01:21.921 --> 01:24.173
"Our makeover will help you
find true love."

01:24.382 --> 01:26.384
That sign speaks the truth.

01:27.093 --> 01:28.677
If you're so inclined…

01:40.439 --> 01:43.233
I invite you to
Beauty Institute Cinderella.

01:40.606 --> 01:44.860
EPISODE 20
YUKAKO YAMAGISHI
DREAMS OF CINDERELLA

01:43.317 --> 01:44.776
Please, come in.

01:45.987 --> 01:48.114
My name is Aya Tsuji.

01:48.572 --> 01:51.658
Sigh… Principal owner
and aesthetician.

01:51.867 --> 01:54.911
Please don't be put off
by my mildly hypotensive cadence.

01:55.329 --> 01:56.371
Sigh…

01:56.622 --> 01:59.166
I'm actually very passionate
about my work.

01:59.458 --> 02:00.542
Sigh…

02:02.837 --> 02:03.796
You…

02:04.422 --> 02:06.340
are quite lovely.

02:06.424 --> 02:07.466
Sigh…

02:08.175 --> 02:12.554
To think such a striking beauty
was hiding right here in Morioh…

02:13.097 --> 02:15.516
Now, if I may ask you to
please have a seat.

02:16.308 --> 02:18.935
Please fill out the form
with your name and address.

02:19.020 --> 02:21.772
I haven't exactly decided
to go through with this.

02:22.189 --> 02:24.191
Of course, may I present you
our list of services.

02:24.358 --> 02:26.568
MAKEOVERS
◯ THE FIND-TRUE-LOVE MAKEOVER….........1000 YEN
◯ THE WIN-YOUR-SOULMATE MAKEOVER…1500 YEN
◯ THE MAKE-THEM-PROPOSE MAKEOVER…2000 YEN
◯ THE MAKE-HIM-OBEDIENT MAKEOVER….3000 YEN
◯ THE MARRY-INTO-MONEY MAKEOVER…..5000 YEN
◯ THE MARRY-A-CELEBRITY MAKEOVER…..7000 YEN

02:25.067 --> 02:26.590
"Marry-a-celebrity makeover"?

02:27.361 --> 02:30.572
My institute is a bit of
a departure from the mainstream.

02:31.032 --> 02:34.577
I construct visages
of good fortune.

02:38.539 --> 02:41.583
One's physiognomy—that is,
the form of one's face—

02:41.208 --> 02:43.919
HIGH BROWS
DOUBLE EYELID
LARGE, WIDE EYES

02:41.667 --> 02:43.794
dictates one's luck.

02:44.170 --> 02:45.671
A face welcoming of love

02:45.755 --> 02:47.923
will increase your chances
of finding love.

02:48.549 --> 02:50.133
Hmm… Too bad.

02:50.217 --> 02:53.887
Your eyes and eyebrows have
an unlucky shape.

02:54.138 --> 02:54.888
Sigh…

02:55.056 --> 02:56.432
I'll come right out and say it.

02:56.557 --> 02:58.600
This is the dumbest shit
I've ever heard.

02:58.726 --> 03:00.144
You're taking people's money
for this?

03:00.352 --> 03:01.644
With these features,

03:01.729 --> 03:05.566
the more you like a boy,
the more he will pull back.

03:06.859 --> 03:07.943
Am I far off?

03:08.277 --> 03:10.445
Is that not true?

03:10.738 --> 03:11.822
You're totally off.

03:11.906 --> 03:13.866
Never in my life has
that happened to me.

03:14.158 --> 03:16.201
Is that so? Very well, then.

03:16.452 --> 03:18.287
In your case…

03:18.913 --> 03:20.497
Oh, you'll have to forgive me.

03:20.581 --> 03:23.458
I haven't quite mastered
computer graphics.

03:24.627 --> 03:26.837
This is a face that
will find true love.

03:27.254 --> 03:30.090
Wait… Are you talking
plastic surgery?

03:30.257 --> 03:31.549
You perform surgery?

03:31.717 --> 03:35.387
I'll achieve this effect with only
makeup and beauty massage.

03:35.763 --> 03:38.015
But be aware you have
only thirty minutes.

03:38.099 --> 03:41.852
If you do not find love,
I will refund your thousand yen.

03:42.103 --> 03:43.437
Shall we give it a go?

03:44.563 --> 03:47.065
Yes. But nothing more
than makeup…

03:47.191 --> 03:50.444
I suppose I can humor you
just this once.

03:50.820 --> 03:54.114
Much obliged.
Let's begin, shall we?

03:54.490 --> 03:56.283
Now close your eyes.

03:58.119 --> 04:00.830
No peeking now, okay…

04:02.623 --> 04:05.125
Whatever you do, do not move.

04:05.209 --> 04:08.962
My hands could slip.

04:11.507 --> 04:12.883
<i>Koichi..</i>

04:15.719 --> 04:18.179
<i>This will help me find true love?</i>

04:19.140 --> 04:21.892
<i>Could changing the contours of
my eyes and eyebrows</i>

04:21.976 --> 04:23.852
<i>really alter my chances?</i>

04:26.480 --> 04:27.189
Koichi?

04:27.273 --> 04:29.525
I-I've been looking for you,
Yukako.

04:29.817 --> 04:31.109
Huh? Me?

04:31.360 --> 04:34.780
Yeah… That was you
walking past Rengatei, right?

04:35.114 --> 04:39.614
You looked so down in the dumps,
you got me kinda worried…

04:40.661 --> 04:41.662
Worried?

04:41.829 --> 04:44.540
You were worried about me, Koichi?

04:44.832 --> 04:47.292
Y-Yeah…
I know a lot has happened,

04:47.376 --> 04:49.252
but that's all water
under the bridge.

04:49.503 --> 04:51.421
I want you to be happy.

04:51.922 --> 04:53.298
R-Really?

04:53.507 --> 04:54.382
Yeah…

04:54.758 --> 04:56.384
<i>I can't believe it…</i>

04:56.510 --> 04:58.345
<i>Could it be the makeup?</i>

04:59.180 --> 05:01.223
K-Koichi…

05:01.557 --> 05:03.225
Instead of standing here,

05:03.309 --> 05:05.394
shall we find a seat
somewhere and chat?

05:05.686 --> 05:06.436
Huh?

05:06.687 --> 05:09.231
U-Um… Only if you want to…

05:09.857 --> 05:11.191
Well…

05:11.358 --> 05:13.651
I guess I am a little thirsty…

05:13.777 --> 05:15.236
Huh? Huh?!

05:16.947 --> 05:18.406
<i>It's really working.</i>

05:18.532 --> 05:20.200
<i>Things are really changing!</i>

05:20.993 --> 05:22.661
<i>- I get to sit at the same table as</i>
- I suddenly have a hankering

05:22.745 --> 05:24.413
<i>- the adorable yet tenacious, Koichi…</i>
- for chocolate parfait.

05:24.622 --> 05:26.248
I guess that makes me
kinda girly…

05:26.498 --> 05:28.291
Huh? No! Not at all!

05:28.500 --> 05:30.752
That's what I wanted, too!

05:31.629 --> 05:32.921
<i>It's like I'm dreaming…</i>

05:33.088 --> 05:34.631
<i>That Physiognomy stuff
really works!</i>

05:34.882 --> 05:36.300
<i>I can feel it…</i>

05:36.550 --> 05:38.885
<i>My luck has really turned!</i>

05:47.228 --> 05:49.438
<i>I… I can't believe it…</i>

05:50.147 --> 05:53.275
<i>I can feel his heartbeat,
the warmth of his body</i>

05:53.567 --> 05:54.734
<i>This is heaven…</i>

05:55.194 --> 05:58.447
<i>I've never been happier
in my entire life.</i>

05:58.739 --> 06:01.032
It's 4! How could it be 4 already?

06:02.743 --> 06:04.286
H-Huh?!

06:05.079 --> 06:06.497
M-My stomach hurts!

06:06.580 --> 06:07.831
Ow…

06:07.957 --> 06:09.500
Y-Yukako, I'm sorry!

06:09.959 --> 06:11.627
I've gotta go home.

06:11.752 --> 06:12.878
K-Koichi!

06:19.677 --> 06:21.512
Why…

06:21.929 --> 06:26.429
Why does it have to be
just thirty minutes?!

06:30.187 --> 06:32.272
Hey, lady!
Can't you see it's a red light?

06:32.356 --> 06:33.398
Shut your ugly trap!

06:33.482 --> 06:35.650
It's not my fault
the light turned red!

06:35.985 --> 06:38.278
Why's it work for only
a measly thirty minutes?!

06:38.362 --> 06:39.988
Make it last longer!

06:40.698 --> 06:42.866
You found love, didn't you?

06:43.033 --> 06:46.703
Be happy with that,
and come back tomorrow.

06:47.121 --> 06:49.498
That's what all
my other customers do.

06:49.623 --> 06:53.084
Never! A fate that tears me away
from Koichi after 30 minutes

06:53.168 --> 06:54.878
is a fate I refuse to endure!

06:55.129 --> 06:55.712
Sigh…

06:55.796 --> 06:58.215
I want the win-your-soulmate
treatment!

06:58.299 --> 06:59.049
You can do that, right?

06:59.133 --> 07:01.218
Graciousness isn't
your strong suit, is it?

07:01.343 --> 07:02.677
I said, "do it!"

07:03.137 --> 07:05.305
Sigh… Yukako.

07:05.472 --> 07:07.432
Cinderella may have
been mistreated,

07:07.516 --> 07:11.019
but she found true love because
she never lost her pure soul.

07:11.228 --> 07:12.687
The moral of the story,

07:12.771 --> 07:15.398
serendipity requires
a willing heart.

07:15.649 --> 07:17.525
Are you up for the challenge?

07:17.818 --> 07:20.237
A willing heart? What do you mean?

07:20.321 --> 07:22.531
To truly transform your luck,

07:22.614 --> 07:25.366
it takes more than
mere physiognomical alteration.

07:25.743 --> 07:26.744
Sigh…

07:26.910 --> 07:30.038
It was Cinderella's Fairy Godmother

07:30.122 --> 07:32.999
who inspired me to become
an aesthetician.

07:33.083 --> 07:36.878
Like her, I want my life to be
about giving joy to others.

07:37.254 --> 07:39.381
You're positively gorgeous,
the apple of my eye.

07:39.965 --> 07:42.175
So I'll do this just for you.

07:42.676 --> 07:43.802
However…

07:44.053 --> 07:47.389
The treatment will involve
more than your face.

07:48.932 --> 07:50.183
Sigh…

07:56.190 --> 07:58.192
A full body treatment…
Top to bottom

07:58.317 --> 08:01.111
We need to create
a "win-your-soulmate" body.

08:01.612 --> 08:04.656
And as an emblem
of that willing heart…

08:05.240 --> 08:07.742
Apply this lipstick
every thirty minutes,

08:07.826 --> 08:09.536
except, of course,
while you're asleep.

08:10.162 --> 08:12.330
It maintains the potency
of the full-body treatment.

08:12.873 --> 08:15.333
If you do,
you will have the chance of

08:15.417 --> 08:17.836
holding on to your soulmate
for all eternity.

08:18.712 --> 08:21.506
The price is 72,000 yen
for 24 hours.

08:21.715 --> 08:23.591
Fine. I'll take it.

08:27.429 --> 08:30.515
Yes… Stay absolutely still, now.

08:30.641 --> 08:32.726
And keep those eyes shut.

08:36.897 --> 08:40.275
I knew you weren't
some ordinary beautician.

08:42.986 --> 08:44.278
Th-This ability…

08:44.405 --> 08:46.657
You can see my Cinderella?

08:47.199 --> 08:50.327
I see… So you're a Stand wielder.

08:51.578 --> 08:54.247
Come to think of it,
I don't really care.

08:54.456 --> 08:58.460
If you wanted to hurt me,
you would've a long time ago.

08:58.669 --> 09:01.630
I trust you.. Fairy Godmother.

09:02.965 --> 09:04.591
You startled me…

09:06.552 --> 09:08.136
Fascinating. Now start.

09:09.596 --> 09:11.014
Such a sublime girl…

09:11.265 --> 09:13.475
All right.
You're in excellent hands.

09:20.107 --> 09:23.693
Cinderella transforms
the body's appearance.

09:24.153 --> 09:27.739
This is the perfect completion to
my "win-your-soulmate" treatment.

09:28.115 --> 09:32.615
Yukako, my dear,
you have become invincible in love.

09:36.665 --> 09:39.501
My stomach suddenly
feels all better…

09:39.626 --> 09:42.712
Oh, this is Yukako's bag!
Whoops!

09:42.796 --> 09:44.672
I have to give it back to her!

09:49.636 --> 09:51.137
Koichi.

09:52.347 --> 09:53.681
Y-Yukako…

10:01.148 --> 10:05.648
O-Oh, yeah.
Here! I brought your bag.

10:05.819 --> 10:06.569
Huh?

10:07.154 --> 10:08.530
This one's mine.

10:08.989 --> 10:11.616
I got 'em mixed up. Sorry!

10:12.534 --> 10:13.868
W-Well, later.

10:14.244 --> 10:16.454
W-Wait, Koichi!

10:16.580 --> 10:17.872
Look at me.

10:20.501 --> 10:25.001
Don't I rouse
any special feelings in you?

10:25.422 --> 10:27.173
W-Well… Well…

10:27.549 --> 10:28.466
Well…

10:31.053 --> 10:33.305
Well, whaddya know, it's Koichi!

10:33.597 --> 10:35.056
Rohan-sensei!

10:35.390 --> 10:38.309
I'm heading to Kameyu
for research.

10:38.519 --> 10:39.895
Come keep me company.

10:40.062 --> 10:42.773
I really need to head home…

10:43.106 --> 10:46.359
I can't be snapping photos in
a department store all by myself.

10:46.693 --> 10:48.277
- I don't get it…
- Come on. It's always about you…

10:48.362 --> 10:49.279
Jeez.

10:49.363 --> 10:52.324
Wasn't I supposed to become
the invincible heroine?!

10:52.449 --> 10:56.286
What happened to
Cinderella's powers?!

10:56.870 --> 10:58.955
- Oh, Ko.
<i>- Rest assured, Koichi has already</i>

10:59.039 --> 11:00.999
- Oh, Mom. Sis.
<i>- fallen deeply for you.</i>

11:01.375 --> 11:04.419
<i>His rational mind is resisting.</i>

11:05.087 --> 11:08.173
<i>Did something happen
between the two of you?</i>

11:08.340 --> 11:09.466
<i>That must be it.</i>

11:09.633 --> 11:12.177
Oh, this fine young man is
a manga artist?

11:12.261 --> 11:15.013
- How wonderful. May we join you?
<i>- All will be fine.</i>

11:15.389 --> 11:17.766
Soon enough, the tables will turn.

11:18.016 --> 11:19.976
Cinderella is absolute.

11:20.394 --> 11:24.606
By the way, it's 4:45.
Your thirty minutes are almost up.

11:25.023 --> 11:27.608
You must not forget the lipstick.

11:27.985 --> 11:30.195
I'm putting it on now.

11:31.071 --> 11:33.615
The tables will turn, huh?

11:34.408 --> 11:37.953
What? You're going to Kameyu?
So are we.

11:38.036 --> 11:38.870
<i>Huh?!</i>

11:39.037 --> 11:40.621
<i>What the hell's going on?!</i>

11:40.998 --> 11:42.666
<i>There are even more of them!</i>

11:42.749 --> 11:45.126
<i>And his mother of all people!</i>

11:45.586 --> 11:49.131
<i>The tables will turn, my ass!</i>

11:49.590 --> 11:52.134
<i>I'll butcher
that bullshitting beautician!</i>

11:52.593 --> 11:54.761
This looks like
a good place to start.

11:59.099 --> 12:01.434
H-Hey, are you using the flash?

12:01.518 --> 12:02.810
This isn't good, Josuke.

12:02.936 --> 12:05.730
The stress is making her disappear!

12:06.607 --> 12:09.026
H-Hey, Old Man!
We've gotta get out of here!

12:09.526 --> 12:10.652
P-Pardon us!

12:10.777 --> 12:12.612
Out of the way!

12:12.696 --> 12:13.321
Huh?

12:13.405 --> 12:14.155
What's going on?

12:14.323 --> 12:14.906
Ah!

12:14.990 --> 12:17.325
Oh, sorry there, Koichi!

12:25.125 --> 12:27.293
Y-Yukako..

12:27.753 --> 12:30.005
K-Koichi…

12:33.967 --> 12:36.344
<i>So… the tables have turned</i>

12:36.803 --> 12:38.054
<i>They really have!</i>

12:39.973 --> 12:42.183
<i>Our hearts are in harmony.</i>

12:42.309 --> 12:45.562
<i>His heart gushes into mine…</i>

12:46.647 --> 12:48.315
<i>Nothing matters but this moment…</i>

12:48.982 --> 12:52.694
<i>My new life begins now..</i>

12:57.783 --> 13:00.452
CINDERELLA
AYA TSUJI

13:00.744 --> 13:02.912
Josuke, Okuyasu…

13:03.121 --> 13:06.707
I… smooched Yukako. Yeah.

13:10.295 --> 13:11.713
FLAIL
FLAIL

13:13.256 --> 13:15.049
What'd she do to you?!

13:15.133 --> 13:18.219
That tease just doesn't learn,
does she?

13:18.512 --> 13:20.764
Just calm down!
It's nothing like that…

13:21.390 --> 13:22.557
I just…

13:22.933 --> 13:26.186
I think I've sorta fallen
for Yukako.

13:26.269 --> 13:27.019
Wha—?

13:27.229 --> 13:31.024
She's actually sorta started
to grow on me…

13:31.149 --> 13:33.025
She makes me feel
all warm and fuzzy inside.

13:33.568 --> 13:35.152
Could this be love?

13:35.362 --> 13:37.405
- Hey, Okuyasu, did you hear that?
- I'm just so confused…

13:37.489 --> 13:40.074
That could shock the pants
off a Stand.

13:40.200 --> 13:42.035
He did what with Yukako…

13:43.036 --> 13:44.328
GUSH

13:46.123 --> 13:49.334
Hey, hey, hey!
This is nothing to cry about!

13:49.584 --> 13:51.043
But, Koichi…

13:51.128 --> 13:54.464
I have no idea what spawned
such a stunning change of heart,

13:54.548 --> 13:57.259
but if you and Yukako
really like each other,

13:57.509 --> 13:59.469
I don't see what's the big deal.

13:59.594 --> 14:01.679
That's not it…

14:02.389 --> 14:05.767
Yukako refuses to see me now.

14:06.560 --> 14:08.103
That's the mystery.

14:08.562 --> 14:10.438
She been absent at school
for two days.

14:10.731 --> 14:11.940
She won't answer the phone…

14:12.107 --> 14:15.193
She won't say a single word.
Nothing. Zero.

14:15.444 --> 14:18.488
Y-You mean ever since
you guys kissed…

14:18.572 --> 14:19.948
Nothing since that day?

14:20.031 --> 14:20.781
Nothing.

14:20.949 --> 14:24.786
Hmm… That is really weird.

14:24.953 --> 14:29.453
You know, I did admire Yukako
for her unrelenting devotion.

14:30.751 --> 14:33.837
Hate to break it to you,
but I think your only option

14:33.920 --> 14:36.130
is to ask Yukako to her face.

14:36.256 --> 14:39.133
We really shouldn't get involved…

14:39.384 --> 14:41.094
Y-Yeah…

14:41.428 --> 14:44.431
But if things turn ugly,
give us a holler!

14:44.765 --> 14:46.141
We'll be there in a flash!

14:46.266 --> 14:48.601
Thanks, guys. Later then.

14:48.685 --> 14:49.435
Yeah.

14:50.353 --> 14:51.479
But…

14:51.646 --> 14:53.606
Damn that Koichi!

14:53.690 --> 14:56.651
- Why does he get to kiss a girl?
- C'mon, it's nothing to get so worked up over.

15:01.531 --> 15:03.824
<i>Th-That hair!</i>

15:04.117 --> 15:05.368
Yukako!

15:06.161 --> 15:08.663
W-Wait, Yukako!

15:09.623 --> 15:11.082
U-Um…

15:16.129 --> 15:19.590
I don't know
who you're referring to.

15:19.674 --> 15:23.969
U-Um… I could've sworn
you looked just like…

15:33.271 --> 15:34.855
No, I mean, wait!

15:39.069 --> 15:40.320
K-Koichi…

15:55.585 --> 15:58.796
How could you do this to me,
you conniving shrew?!

15:59.005 --> 16:00.506
My face is falling apart!

16:00.632 --> 16:02.717
The makeup just stuffs off!

16:06.763 --> 16:09.390
You wretched whore of a woman!

16:09.474 --> 16:11.350
Turn my face back!

16:13.103 --> 16:17.603
It would seem
you've broken your promise.

16:18.692 --> 16:20.110
It's such a shame.

16:20.360 --> 16:23.488
And here I made doubly sure
that you knew to apply

16:23.572 --> 16:25.740
the Cinderella lipstick
every thirty minutes…

16:25.824 --> 16:28.243
It slipped my mind, that's all!

16:29.077 --> 16:31.996
Wh-What's happening? My hands…

16:34.291 --> 16:36.042
They're breaking down!

16:36.126 --> 16:38.586
Your palm lines and
fingerprints are disappearing.

16:38.879 --> 16:41.298
You shouldn't break your promises.

16:41.590 --> 16:45.552
That lipstick was your assurance
of good luck.

16:45.886 --> 16:47.762
A tremendous amount
of energy is required

16:47.846 --> 16:49.889
to change the course
of one's destiny.

16:50.265 --> 16:51.975
And it is no longer.

16:52.100 --> 16:55.686
You have only yourself to blame for
not taking your destiny seriously.

16:55.896 --> 16:57.689
D-Do you want to die?!

16:58.023 --> 16:59.357
Die?

16:59.441 --> 17:03.736
Ambition and wealth aren't the only
motivating factors of my work.

17:03.862 --> 17:06.865
My role model was
Cinderella's fairy godmother,

17:06.990 --> 17:10.576
sorceress and bringer of happiness.

17:10.911 --> 17:12.829
It's really such a shame.

17:12.913 --> 17:16.708
I should have never tried to
make your wish come true.

17:16.958 --> 17:19.418
Your face and palms
are now long gone.

17:19.502 --> 17:21.504
They have been erased
from this world.

17:22.130 --> 17:23.589
What… did you say?

17:23.673 --> 17:25.257
They're gone.

17:25.383 --> 17:28.010
And this world has no use
for things with missing parts.

17:28.511 --> 17:31.347
My face… is gone?

17:31.431 --> 17:34.642
What kind of life does a person
with missing parts live?

17:34.726 --> 17:35.893
Yukako!

17:37.938 --> 17:39.606
<i>K-Koichi!</i>

17:40.065 --> 17:41.357
<i>Why is he here…?</i>

17:41.483 --> 17:43.651
<i>No, I can't…
He'll know everything.</i>

17:43.777 --> 17:48.114
N-No, you've got the wrong person.

17:48.573 --> 17:52.326
Dr. Aya, your beauty institute
is for women only, correct?

17:52.577 --> 17:53.911
Get him out of here.

17:56.957 --> 17:59.292
That's the personality…

17:59.626 --> 18:01.836
That tough-as-nails temperament.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.504
That's definitely Yukako.

18:04.881 --> 18:07.508
That personality kinda
got to me, in a good way…

18:08.009 --> 18:11.929
And that lady is
a Stand user, right?

18:12.389 --> 18:15.058
And she did something to you…

18:16.476 --> 18:17.852
<i>It's all over.</i>

18:17.936 --> 18:19.520
<i>I can't live like this.</i>

18:20.313 --> 18:22.732
I'll murder you, Aya Tsuji!

18:22.816 --> 18:24.567
I'll murder you!

18:24.693 --> 18:26.569
Don't despair.

18:30.865 --> 18:34.493
That's… P-Part of her face
went flying!

18:34.619 --> 18:36.203
There we go.

18:36.329 --> 18:37.246
Sigh…

18:38.123 --> 18:41.042
So this is Koichi… Sigh…

18:41.167 --> 18:43.085
He saw through your altered state

18:43.169 --> 18:45.671
to identify you as
Yukako Yamagishi.

18:46.006 --> 18:48.800
Impressive… And the words
came out of her own mouth.

18:48.883 --> 18:51.385
Some people have
an eye for character.

18:51.720 --> 18:53.304
All right, Yukako.

18:53.430 --> 18:55.306
Out of consideration
for his efforts,

18:55.390 --> 18:59.519
I'll give you one final chance
as a fairy godmother.

19:00.478 --> 19:04.978
You have one chance
to choose one of these.

19:05.900 --> 19:08.402
Your real face is no more.

19:08.528 --> 19:13.028
But Cinderella remembers
the face of each and every patient.

19:14.534 --> 19:17.787
Select your own face from
among the samples.

19:18.204 --> 19:19.914
If you can find your own,

19:19.998 --> 19:22.458
your original features
could be restored.

19:22.542 --> 19:25.253
Your palms and fingerprints, too.

19:25.670 --> 19:28.297
Like Cinderella
and her glass slipper,

19:28.381 --> 19:30.591
I invite you
to find your perfect fit.

19:31.426 --> 19:34.053
Well, you should've just said so,
Dr. Dumbass!

19:34.137 --> 19:35.930
Nothing but child's play!

19:36.056 --> 19:39.059
I look at my face
in the mirror every friggin day!

19:39.726 --> 19:42.603
But if you choose
someone else's face,

19:42.729 --> 19:45.398
it will inevitably clash
with your own.

19:45.482 --> 19:49.982
I take that back,
as an authority on beauty,

19:50.487 --> 19:54.282
I can say your face
will become grotesque.

19:54.365 --> 19:58.702
And the contours of that face
will dictate your destiny.

20:03.458 --> 20:04.792
Y-Yukako…

20:04.959 --> 20:06.543
Be extra careful.

20:06.628 --> 20:09.297
Remember, your face in
a mirror is reversed.

20:09.923 --> 20:11.549
R-Right…

20:12.634 --> 20:15.178
<i>The correct choice is none of them.</i>

20:15.762 --> 20:18.431
<i>None of the faces are yours.</i>

20:18.556 --> 20:19.515
<i>Figure that out</i>

20:19.599 --> 20:21.601
<i>and I'll return your face
to its original appearance.</i>

20:22.102 --> 20:24.312
<i>That is the Fairy Godmother's rule.</i>

20:24.687 --> 20:26.355
The more I second guess,

20:26.439 --> 20:28.065
the more other faces
look like mine…

20:28.775 --> 20:29.525
But…

20:30.110 --> 20:32.195
This is it! It has to be!

20:32.278 --> 20:34.613
I know, because it's my own face!

20:34.823 --> 20:36.241
Are you sure?

20:36.324 --> 20:38.576
You'll find out once you try it on.

20:52.132 --> 20:55.135
N-No… This isn't it.

20:55.301 --> 20:58.637
My eyes have more of a slant.

20:58.721 --> 21:00.514
Wh-Which one is it?

21:00.598 --> 21:03.100
I-I have no idea…

21:10.483 --> 21:12.860
What's wrong? Choose.

21:13.528 --> 21:16.906
No, I won't choose.

21:16.990 --> 21:17.782
Wha—

21:18.158 --> 21:19.284
What are you saying?

21:19.367 --> 21:21.452
You want to live life faceless?

21:21.870 --> 21:24.038
I'll have Koichi choose.

21:25.707 --> 21:28.876
Because… all that matters
is that Koichi chose it.

21:29.002 --> 21:33.502
I don't care what it looks like
or what luck it has.

21:34.424 --> 21:36.050
The rest I can bear.

21:36.176 --> 21:38.344
And I will live free of regret.

21:38.553 --> 21:40.596
B-But that's not…

21:41.723 --> 21:43.307
I don't care.

21:46.352 --> 21:48.812
Please choose, Koichi.

21:49.689 --> 21:51.357
O-Okay…

21:59.365 --> 22:00.282
This is it.

22:01.075 --> 22:03.994
I don't have a reason,
it's just a feeling.

22:04.370 --> 22:07.081
If I do choose the wrong face…

22:08.458 --> 22:11.627
Oh, and by the way,
that's Reverb, my Stand.

22:11.711 --> 22:15.631
I, I want you to wound
Reverb's eyes,

22:15.715 --> 22:17.883
so I will never see again.

22:19.260 --> 22:21.553
You said
you wouldn't have any regrets,

22:21.679 --> 22:23.347
but knowing you,

22:23.514 --> 22:27.518
I know it'd upset you if I couldn't
see you as you always were.

22:28.061 --> 22:31.147
I've fallen in love with you.

22:31.231 --> 22:33.233
I couldn't bear to see you unhappy.

22:33.650 --> 22:37.111
The best solution is for me
to never see again.

22:41.407 --> 22:42.783
Koichi…

22:42.867 --> 22:44.368
Here, Yukako…

22:44.494 --> 22:45.369
Yes.

22:58.883 --> 23:00.885
L-Look, Koichi!

23:01.010 --> 23:01.969
A perfect fit!

23:02.345 --> 23:03.262
Koichi!

23:03.346 --> 23:05.264
We did it, Yukako!

23:05.390 --> 23:09.477
- It's because you chose my face, Koichi!
- To think he would ask her to blind him

23:09.560 --> 23:12.271
<i>so he wouldn't see her face…</i>

23:12.647 --> 23:15.024
<i>I figured, as Fairy Godmother,
I should bend the rules</i>

23:15.108 --> 23:16.943
<i>and do a little repair work
of my own.</i>

23:17.026 --> 23:19.945
<i>Now if I took the eyesight of
an innocent young man,</i>

23:20.071 --> 23:22.698
<i>what kind of Fairy Godmother
would that make me?</i>

23:22.949 --> 23:27.449
Yukako, my dear, you certainly
have an eye for finding good men.

23:28.496 --> 23:31.290
<i>Beauty Institute Cinderella
is open for business.</i>

23:31.958 --> 23:34.710
<i>Our makeovers will help you
find true love.</i>

23:38.798 --> 23:42.009
EPISODE 21
YOSHIKAGE KIRA
JUST WANTS TO LIVE QUIETLY, PART 1
